## Important Notes
- Only extract information that is clearly present or strongly inferable
- Do not fabricate data
- Use null for missing information
- Provide confidence scores for uncertain extractions
- Focus on factual business intelligence
- Ignore marketing fluff and focus on concrete details
- Return ONLY valid JSON, no additional text or explanation
